# AC-010 — normalized_pql field on StructuredErrorFields (BC-2.11.023)
# Demonstrates: D1 mode-bridge error populates normalized_pql rewrite in MCP structured error.

Output docs/demo-evidence/S-DEMO-PRISMQL-GRAMMAR-REMEDIATION-001/AC-010-normalized-pql.gif
Output docs/demo-evidence/S-DEMO-PRISMQL-GRAMMAR-REMEDIATION-001/AC-010-normalized-pql.webm

Require cargo

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontFamily "FiraCode Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set Framerate 30
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Sleep 1s
Show

Type "bash /tmp/run_ac010.sh"
Enter
Sleep 15s
